{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JA-bQCCPsYfEKCJeCh4OFQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:07.123319+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JA-bQCCPsYfEKCJeCh4OFQ","html":"<div><section><section><p><span>根据学校关于做好接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作要求，现将我院接收推免生复试录取工作的具体要求及安排通知如下：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、招生专业及系统报名时间</span></strong></p><p><span>招生专业: 物理学、地球物理学、控制工程、大数据技术与工程。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/8T6pdeibNnGGAqtacsCg0FztlG7daicNkibQhtRnibsOR0dtThUvHMRP1qI2bal155vr6ZZpI4JRu9soCVGsk8gGIL14NvBI3amNIdCn8kBsV70/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>本科直博生在复试时向招生单位提出直博申请，其招生数根据学生报名情况及复试情况确定。</span></p><p><span>报名系统开放时间：2026年9月1日09:00-2026年9月14日17:00，考生登录山东大学研究生招生平台（https://yanzhao.sdu.edu.cn）（点击文末”阅读原文“查看），选择“推免预报名”，首次登录系统请注册，已参加我院2026年太空探索暑期夏令营的考生无需再次注册。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>申请我院推免生的考生，须符合以下基本条件：</span></p><p><span>（一）全日制应届本科毕业生，并在本科就读学校取得推荐免试资格；</span></p><p><span>（二）遵纪守法，品行优良，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><span>（三）学风端正，无任何考试作弊或剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></p><p><span>（四）符合我校当年招生简章和招生专业目录中规定的报考条件；</span></p><p><span>（五）身心健康，符合国家及我校的相关体检要求。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请材料</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）申请攻读研究生报告，内容包括个人信息简介，学习、科研简要经历，对申请专业的认识及未来学习和科研规划等；</span></p><p><span>（二）思想政治素质和品德考核表；</span></p><p><span>（三）本科阶段成绩单，须加盖学校教务主管部门公章；</span></p><p><span>（四）外语水平证明或外语资格考试成绩单；</span></p><p><span>（五）重要获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>（六）体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等材料；</span></p><p><span>（七）在校期间参军入伍服兵役、参加志愿服务、到国际组织实习等证明材料；</span></p><p><span>（八）回避情况说明。凡有直系亲属或利益相关人员在我校工作，尤其是在所申请推免的校内招生单位工作的，要主动说明报备。对未按规定报备声明回避关系且影响推免过程和结果公平公正的学生，学校将取消其推免录取资格；</span></p><p><span>（九）本人签名的诚信承诺书。</span></p><p><span>以上材料均无需邮寄，在报名系统上传即可。收到复试通知的同学于9月16日17:00前在预推免系统确认是否参加复试。考生须对所提交材料的真实性负责。对提交虚假材料或弄虚作假者，无论何时，一经发现，即取消录取资格或学籍，并按教育部相关规定严肃处理。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、思想政治素质和品德考核</span></strong></p><p><span>思想政治素质和品德考核由考核小组根据考生申请材料，结合考生的政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等方面的现实表现来开展。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、复试安排</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）复试方式：</span></p><p><span>本次推免采用线下复试方式。</span></p><p><span>（二）复试方案：</span></p><p><span>复试采用面试的形式，成绩满分100分，复试成绩低于60分者不得录取。面试包括英语听力及口语能力考查（30%），专业综合知识和综合素质考核（70%）。</span></p><p><span>（三）考核内容：</span></p><p><span>坚持德智体美劳全面衡量，以德为先，把学生思想品德考核作为选拔考核的重要内容和录取的重要依据。严格遵循实事求是的原则，注重对学生政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、科学精神、诚实守信、遵纪守法等方面的考查，思想品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></p><p><span>在对考生进行考核时，既注重学业知识考核，也加强对考生专业能力素质和科研创新潜质的考查；既注重学生的考试成绩，也注重学生的一贯表现。同时将结合学科特点，加强对学生的科学精神、学术道德、专业伦理和社会主义核心价值观等方面的考核评价。</span></p><p><span>（四）拟录取排名</span></p><p><span>各专业/方向录取名次按照复试成绩由高到低进行排序。录取结果将会在空间科学与技术学院网站公示。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、时间安排</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）学院成立材料审核小组对推免生的申请材料进行打分，并在官网公示。9月15日17:00前，空间科学与技术学院将在学院官网公示进入复试名单。请申请学生及时关注空间科学与技术学院网站信息，并保持联系方式畅通。</span></p><p><span>（二）9月17日15:00-17:00考生进行资格审查，请考生带好申请材料及身份证前往闻天楼北楼533办公室进行资格审查，资格审查不合格者不能参加后续招录程序。</span></p><p><span>（三）9月18日上午9:00开始复试，复试地点另行通知。</span></p><p><span>（四）复试结束后，拟录取学生请登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”，及时接收招生单位发送的复试通知和拟录取通知，完成推免生拟录取程序。没有在规定时间内完成推免生拟录取程序的考生，拟录取资格无效。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/mIShLLnJibQIsWuSpcHWM4ib5rYtickRSyhO3zu3S6RLjMYBe7tibkonibGs2QLGe5U3NNVic05luicicn4XSWCbh3brhxztWXEqePjaLQnEMpZcdVc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、其他</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）未参加我院预报名的推免生，可在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”开通后，登录系统进行报名。我院将根据招生计划情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织考核，具体安排以学院通知为准。</span></p><p><span>（二）对在推免过程中弄虚作假，有论文抄袭、虚报获奖或科研成果等学术不端行为或者有其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的学生，一经查实，即取消推免资格，已入学的，取消学籍，并将按规定记入《国家教育考试考生诚信档案》。</span></p><p><span>（三）考生应自觉树立遵章守纪、诚实考试的意识。复试期间，考生应自觉遵守考场规则及考生所签署的《诚信复试承诺书》等内容，不得对外透露或传播复试试题内容等有关信息。</span></p><p><span>（四）已被我校接收的推免生，不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生考试招生，否则将取消其推免录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（五）对于未达到推荐高校提出的本科应届毕业学年学业成绩等要求、或拟录取后至本科毕业前发生严重违法违规违纪行为的推免生，学校将取消其推免录取资格。对于本科毕业后至研究生入学前出现上述情况的，学校将取消其推免录取资格。</span></p><p><span>（六）本简章未尽事宜均以教育部和学校相关文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>推免生接收相关事宜咨询电话：0631- 5688780，何老师。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8T6pdeibNnGGR7x77k2j7YibcqYSTAPHf90aKctoHvPHqawJ004WQbAzUlueJUuChv6SzK4BjTf9FU9VVaaeZjTZviceXknicicSRGe3ZvgXjzEE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8T6pdeibNnGEicEHRk0ia0ZkpUbvdnWUbOS0oYnXYatjGOrRmqIxia7yetR3sLJWcFBffX3tia83vmuhYnl7OiaC5Bqqx58HAGUDjpEePyLyPI6f0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>山东大学空间科学与技术学院</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>公众号ID：SDUSST</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section></section></section></section><section><p><span>长按识别左侧二维码关注我们</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a209121003540c72abd1976faa6be537d3582f7ad4a18f075ef2ed057b6f6d99","textLength":2238,"sourceSha256":"7bb859ce7878884efd9970a25cddd2cf3abf2c234e786dfdb045dbecb5545daa","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-237093f707f8178b1edd","title":"2026年山东大学空间科学与技术学院2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）复试工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:07.123319+00:00"}
